{% comment %}
  Full-viewport p5 bird intro shown over the real homepage.

  The visible "seventeen / eighteen / nineteen" mark is drawn by p5 on the canvas,
  never in the DOM, so it is not rendered twice. The button below is a real,
  keyboard-operable control over the same interaction, sized to the centred mark.

  Gating (homepage only, and never in the theme editor) lives in layout/theme.liquid.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="flock-intro" data-flock-intro>
  <div class="flock-intro__canvas" data-flock-canvas></div>

  <button
    class="flock-intro__trigger"
    type="button"
    data-flock-trigger
    aria-label="Enter seventeeneighteennineteen"
  ></button>
</div>

{%- comment -%} Only JS can take the overlay down, so without JS it must never cover the page. {%- endcomment -%}
<noscript>
  <style>
    .flock-intro { display: none; }
  </style>
</noscript>
